<speak>Both, I think. He was very pleased about the table, but he has used the folders already. He found an appliance booklet without asking me where it was, and made quite a point of telling me. I congratulated him as though he had completed a difficult expedition. We were joking, of course, but it showed that the labels helped. He has promised not to create a new pile beside the cupboard, which is usually how these things start all over again.</speak>